as the body of  Melly Otis but apparently zelgius is  also strong enough to allow the demon  king to use his full potential but the  demon king is going to need some time to  gain complete control of the vessel as I  predicted in last week's video about the  shocking return of zeldron  the demon king has learned his lesson  from the epic battle against meliodas  and the others he now realizes how  strong the sins are and he is not about  to underestimate them again in the  previous video I said that the demon  king might summon the powerful Endora  monsters from the demon realm in order  to help him deal with the sins and that  is exactly what he does in this chapter  the demon king knows that now that  Elizabeth's curse has been restored the  sins will find his whereabouts  eventually so he uses the gate that  Merlin had made earlier in order to  summon a massive Endura beast from the  demon realm now the gate that Merlin had  opened was only big enough for a human  to pass through and there was never any  real danger of a powerful demon entering  this realm through the gate but the  demon king uses his own power to tear  the gate open and summon an enduro the  very manifestation of destruction and  death the sins can instantly sense what  is happening and they decided go thermal  and King the N and bond will deal with  the Endura while Mel Yodas and Elizabeth  face off against the demon king poor  hawk and Eska nor are tasked with  informing King Batra and the rest of the  kingdom about what is happening which is  not the most glorious task to say the  least but hey what can you do because  Elizabeth's curse is back meliodas has  to protect her and he cannot let her out  of his sight which means that the two of  them must stay together and face the  demon king together meanwhile meliodas  and Elizabeth are fully aware that the  demon King's new vessel is zelgius but  meliodas does not tell the rest of the  sins about this he says that this is  between him his brother Zell drous and  their old man the demon king and he  doesn't want to involve anyone else when  she decides to come with him Elizabeth  hands meliodas his sacred treasure the  demon sword lost vein now to be honest  I've never really considered melioidosis  sacred treasure to be that important it  played an important role in defeating  the Endura from the prisoners of the sky  seven deadly sins movie but other than  that lost vein never really seemed to be  like an essential item for meliodas  however we will see if now in this new  arc lost Wayne will actually play a more  central role perhaps some new different  powers and abilities related to lost  vein will be revealed the fact that  Elizabeth makes it a point of returning  the sacred treasure to meliodas at this  time seems significant to me  and I do expect the lost lane will play  some role in the story in the near  future the chapter ends with Mellie Otis  and Elizabeth flying off together to  save zelgius and we get another  beautiful moment between them that gives  us further insight into why these two  fell in love with each other in the  first place  Mellie Otis says to Elizabeth you've  always held my hand and been by my side  you've pushed me and given me courage  you were my light it's all those things  about you that made me fall in love with  you and I really can't overstate how  much I feel that Elizabeth's character  has developed as we've learned more and  more about her she clearly had such a  massive impact on Mellie Otis and his  life for thousands of years and their  love is an inspirational one the human  reincarnation of Elizabeth starts off as  a pretty simple and basic character if  we're being honest but Elizabeth as a  whole including her complete character  arc spanning over a hundred lives is  definitely an excellent and fascinating  character my takeaway from this chapter  is that we are gearing up for a massive  showdown one that will be even bigger  than the previous battle against the  demon king by summoning the Endura  and perhaps even more than one Endora  the demon king shows us that he has  learned his lesson and he has no  intention of fighting meliodas Elizabeth  and the other sins on his own the demon  king has two major factors working in  his favor first  Mellie Otis is not supposed to be here  he was supposed to return to the demon  realm and every extra moment that he  spends in the mortal plane brings about  more disaster and destruction to  Britannia it is only a matter of time  before meliodas begins to feel too  guilty to remain here because he doesn't  want innocent people to suffer so in  this sense the demon king has time on  his side  second Elizabeth's curse has now  returned so at any moment Mellie Otis is  going to have to pay close attention to  Elizabeth in order to keep her safe this  means that Mellie Otis cannot be fully  focused on the battle against the demon  king because he will constantly be  looking over his shoulder for any  potential threat to Elizabeth this is an  additional thing that meliodas has to  worry about and this certainly works in  the demon King's favor  however the demon king also has to  factors working against him first as he  said himself he will need more time to  gain complete control of his new vessel  so if malleolus and Elizabeth can  locate him right away is possible that  the demon king won't be able to face  them at full power  second the real Zell dress is still  there inside his own body and the love  of his life gelda is also out there  somewhere we saw that in the previous  battle Mele Otis was able to resist the  demon Kings control from the inside and  especially after Elisabeth and the  others were allowed to speak to him  through golfers and evasion ability so  theoretically the demon king may face a  similar issue with celtris if the real  Zell dress is able to regain  consciousness on the inside and if he  realizes that gelda has been released  from the seal and is out there looking  for him Zell drous may be able to resist  the demon Kings control long enough for  meliodas to defeat him I expect that  this arc will bring sell justice  character development to the next level  as he struggles between his loyalty to  his father the ruler of the demon clan  and his desire to be with gelda and  changed a demon realm for the better his  desire to rule in a more fair and more  harmonious way than his father has ruled  I also expect that the battle will  spread to include all of our favourite  characters in one way or another  not just the sins and I'm expecting to  see my L in the one mode and also  Eskin or potentially getting sunshine  back so that he can once more be a  useful member of the team at any rate I  am certainly glad that the story didn't  just end as abruptly as it seemed that  it would and I'm happy that the  complicated relationship between Mele  Otis celtris and their father is going  to receive further development I can't  wait to see what happens next let me  know what you guys think are you excited  for this new art and how do you think  that the battle is going to unfold is  the demon king going to summon just one  Endora or a whole bunch of them is he  going to face meliodas head-on or is he  going to hide out and bite his time  until he gains complete control of his  new vessel and what role is gelda going  to play in all of this let me know down  in the comments if you enjoyed the seven  deadly sins content on this channel and  you want to see more you can leave a  like to let me know and if you're new to  anime uproar please don't forget to  subscribe and hit that notification bell  also don't forget to check out our brand  new bond love the pain and Eska Noir all  hail Diwan shirts on anime out Broadcom  a huge thank you to all of our anime  uproar patrons for supporting our  work on when I especially thank our pro  hero tier patrons the one and only  Gilgamesh keel on and chubs is the man  and another huge thank you to our the  one to your patrons the ones who stand  above all other glands including  ace Maddy Mac James a Lola madam Ingrid  ah and Ahmad and at the very pinnacle of  interdimensional greatness the tier  reserved only for legends a massive  thank you to baby ray the first-ever  disciple of Lord to ego himself if you  guys feel that our content provides  value for you and you want to support  more be sure to check out our patreon  link in the description even donating a  single dollar will give you access to  our anime up for patron exclusive  discord and your name will appear in our  videos along with these amazing people  as always thank you guys so much for  watching I really appreciate it and  until next time see us space cowboys  [Music]
 

